  "title": "Perplexity AI Makes Waves with New Sonar API Launch",
  "summary": "Perplexity AI has launched its innovative Sonar API, promising to reshape the AI search landscape with real-time internet connectivity and competitive pricing tiers. Offered in a base version for simple queries and a Pro version for complex searches, Sonar is already integrated into platforms like Zoom. Backed by substantial funding and boasting superior accuracy claims, Sonar presents a new frontier in AI-powered search solutions.",
